cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "kardashev: Open US ISO/RTO energy data library"
abstract: >-
  Python client for public US ISO/RTO energy data (CAISO, ERCOT, MISO, NYISO,
  ISO-NE, SPP, PJM): LMP, load, fuel mix, carbon intensity, curtailment, and
  interconnection queues. Direct ISO scrapers plus an optional hosted Client
  for data.kardashevlabs.org. This is a software citation, not a frozen
  archive of the live API. Production LMP on the hosted API is a rolling
  window. Underlying observations come from the ISOs and should be cited
  alongside this library.
